    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- Watch the demo illustrating how vague prompts lead to plain results.\r\n- Observe the demo showing how specific prompts generate desired results.\r\n- Locate the simulated prompt input area within the widget.\r\n- Interact with the toggle \"switches\" to add specific details to the prompt.\r\n- Note how the sample decision wheel visually changes based on the added details.",
